    <statement><p>Let
<me>f(x) = 3 x^{1/5}(x^3 - 5).</me>
Evaluate the following specific values of <m>f'</m>:</p>
<p>(A) <m>f'(1)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>(B) <m>f'(5)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{3}{5}\cdot 1^{\frac{1}{5}-1}\mathopen{}\left(1^{3}-5\right)+3\cdot 1^{\frac{1}{5}}\cdot 3\cdot 1^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{3}{5}\cdot 5^{\frac{1}{5}-1}\mathopen{}\left(5^{3}-5\right)+3\cdot 5^{\frac{1}{5}}\cdot 3\cdot 5^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
